Olympiad problems and packages
------------------------------

imo2026/base/IMO2026/
  Formal Lean 4 statements of the IMO 2026 problems, from
  https://github.com/AxiomMath/IMO2026 (MIT License, AxiomMath). The problems
  themselves belong to the International Mathematical Olympiad.

ioi2026/problems/
  Official IOI 2026 statements, contestant attachments, graders, headers and
  public examples, copied unchanged from the official IOI 2026 release and
  the official IOI task archive. They belong to the International Olympiad in
  Informatics and are distributed under its terms.

icho2026/*/inputs/ and other copies of the IChO 2026 theory paper
  The official IChO 2026 theoretical problems (PDF and page images) and any
  official solutions or marking schemes quoted for post-run grading. They
  belong to the International Chemistry Olympiad organisers and are
  distributed under their terms.

ipho2026/
  Problem statements and official solutions or marking schemes of the 56th
  International Physics Olympiad (IPhO 2026) referred to or quoted in the
  solutions and grading reports belong to the IPhO organisers.

ibo2024/
  The answer patterns in official-answers.tsv and any quoted question text
  are derived from the official IBO 2024 Theoretical Exam papers, which belong
  to the International Biology Olympiad. The papers are not redistributed here.


Benchmarks and datasets
-----------------------

